# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# TWO DELIBERATE NON-ENTRIES. Both are mistakes the engine repo made.
#
#   results/   is NOT ignored. The engine ignores bench/results/ and *.csv,
#              so `git ls-files` returns zero result files and every A100
#              number it publishes exists only as prose (CLAIMS_AUDIT.md:6).
#              Every number this repo publishes must resolve to a committed
#              artifact. Do not add results/ here.
#
#   *.md       is NOT ignored. The engine's .gitignore:25-26 is `*.md` +
#              `!README.md`, so every doc it writes is silently untracked and
#              a reader following a pointer finds nothing.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
dist/
build/
.venv/
venv/

# Testing / tooling
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# Model weights — large, gated, never committed
weights/
*.safetensors
*.gguf

# Local environment
.env
.DS_Store
*.swp

# Slurm scratch output — the ARTIFACT goes in results/, the raw job log does not
slurm-*.out
*.log
logs/

# Editor
.idea/
.vscode/
